+# CEO G2-B0 Execution Plan
+
+Spec: Human G2-B0 authorization and accepted CEO v1.0 minimal change scope; G2-A is preserved local checkpoint db002b0.
+Goal: full-report archive + single payment-performance preparation + synthetic end-to-end readiness package, without production integration.
+Constraints: use same isolated tree, never read credentials or raw identifiable order data; no real DB/log/service writes; no executor; no cleanup of blocked directories; real bindings UNVERIFIED unless existing evidence proves them.
+Architecture: existing G1 governance and G2-A context/trace reused; immutable file objects in synthetic owned root; content-bound manifest receipt, trace-commit status; deterministic payment adapter with trusted host approval only. WorkBuddy supplies reasoning candidates, never authority/tool execution.
+Review focus: false VERIFIED approval, conflating paid orders/units with shipped sales, cross-currency/timezone/window, partial archive vs complete success, concurrent retries/restart, correction history, host-forged runtime version.
+
+- [x] Snapshot G2-A and protect baseline; preserve all prior evidence and residues.
+- [x] Read-only bounded source inventory: source/field/time/status/unit/store mapping/reviewer, no repeated DB search. Write connection-contract evidence with UNVERIFIED gates.
+- [x] Full immutable Context/report/evidence archive with injected trusted owner API, synthetic filesystem adapter, dedup/conflict/recovery; authorization before writes; RED/GREEN.
+- [x] Paid-order performance snapshot contract and synthetic adapter; approved dictionary overlay in synthetic inputs only, no real dictionary edits; zero/null, statuses, refunds, currencies, exact period/tz, approval/content binding RED/GREEN.
+- [x] Minimal question-to-report workflow: explicit fixed Chinese goal, verified facts and gaps, hypotheses, <=3 grounded priorities with acceptance criteria, archive and trace receipt linkage, Human correction -> new report version. No tasks/executors.
+- [x] Independent review, fixes with RED/GREEN, targeted new/G2-A compatibility. Full historical failures only if actual chain changes justify it; do not repeat completed tests unnecessarily.
+- [x] Report, incremental diff, evidence hashes, G2-B1 gates and Human decisions; stop.
+
+Implementation subtask files are disjoint. Original G1 tree and main config remain unchanged. No design reconfirmation per explicit authorization.
+
+Completed: new34/34, G2-A related68/68, demo2 complete report revisions/3 events/unchanged synthetic DB. Full historical suite not rerun. Scope review three Important resolved. Real bindings all UNVERIFIED. No B1 or production action.
